# Bot2's own Kokusho (mana value 5, but not a creature Bot1 controls) ask Bot1 nothing (`! Bot1.Accept`).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Doc Ock's Tentacles
Cogwork Librarian
Kokusho, the Evening Star
Swamp
Swamp x4

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Kokusho, the Evening Star
Island x12

