Bot1.Hand.Doc Ock's Tentacles.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cogwork Librarian.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
